1
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:12,060
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,100
=Episode 10=

3
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,580
You worked so hard to get into Xinghai.

4
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,420
Are you really going to leave now?

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,540
Of course I don't want to.

6
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,340
But I don't want those men getting
the wrong idea about me either.

7
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,300
Back then, He Lan

8
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,420
gave up his whole future for you.

9
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,620
I don't believe he'd just stand by
and let Mr. Chen treat you like this.

10
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,660
Maybe to He Lan,

11
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,220
the past is just the past now.

12
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,020
If you leave,

13
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:50,700
Xinghai will owe Yunshan
a huge amount of money.

14
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,460
I don't think Xinghai
will necessarily let you go.

15
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:57,980
Cheer up.

16
00:00:58,420 --> 00:00:59,700
I'll take you somewhere fun tonight

17
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:00,540
so you can blow off some steam.

18
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:02,460
Tonight?

19
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:03,660
Don't you have work?

20
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,100
I'm such a great employee.

21
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,380
Skipping work once won't matter.

22
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:06,980
It's fine.

23
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:07,820
My boss will understand.

24
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:08,580
Where are we going?

25
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,660
You'll see when we get there.

26
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:16,180
What would you like to drink?

27
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:17,260
I...

28
00:01:17,860 --> 00:01:18,820
I think I'll pass.

29
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:20,020
What do you mean, pass?

30
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:21,020
We came here to drink.

31
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:22,020
I'd like

32
00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:22,620
a Margarita.

33
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:31,500
You guys are such lightweights.

34
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:32,340
That's all you can drink?

35
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:32,860
Come on.

36
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:33,100
Keep going.

37
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:33,900
I finished mine already.

38
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,140
Who says I'm a lightweight?

39
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,060
Bottoms up! Come on!

40
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:38,140
You have to finish that one!

41
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:42,980
Of all people...

42
00:01:45,460 --> 00:01:46,660
I can't drink anymore.

43
00:01:46,820 --> 00:01:47,980
Just pour a little more.

44
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:48,460
It's fine.

45
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:49,060
Drink up.

46
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:49,660
(Fill mine up again.)

47
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:50,260
Is it good?

48
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:51,060
(Fill it up.)

49
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:51,540
(Fill this one too.)

50
00:01:51,540 --> 00:01:51,940
(Absolutely.)

51
00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:52,620
(This one too.)

52
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:12,460
Luo Xiyu really left
Xinghai Ballet Company?

53
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,100
She's something else.

54
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:21,860
Even hanging out at bars now?

55
00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:23,340
Okay.

56
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:24,140
Got it.

57
00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:38,020
Now this is surprising.

58
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:40,020
After dancing by the pool,

59
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,900
even a little fairy like you
comes to bars now?

60
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:52,460
Did you just come out of this stall?

61
00:02:54,180 --> 00:02:55,220
Stop beating around the bush.

62
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:56,420
What do you want?

63
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:57,500
There's a hidden camera.

64
00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:58,420
See for yourself.

65
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:03,180
It's on that sign.

66
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:05,180
(Please Flush After Use.
Dispose of Paper in the Bin.)

67
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:18,620
That's disgusting.

68
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:20,100
There's one in every stall.

69
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:22,460
The bar owner probably installed them.

70
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:24,220
What are you doing?

71
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:24,860
Calling the police.

72
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:27,900
Luo Xiyu, are you trying to ruin me?

73
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,900
They're about to choose
the new principal.

74
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:31,900
If this blows up, how am I supposed
to face anyone?

75
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:34,660
Then if we don't call the police,

76
00:03:34,780 --> 00:03:35,820
what do you want to do?

77
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:39,500
Don't call the police.

78
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:41,100
This is my business.

79
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:42,020
I'll handle it myself.

80
00:03:46,220 --> 00:03:46,900
Excuse me!

81
00:03:48,220 --> 00:03:49,020
Where's your boss?

82
00:03:49,180 --> 00:03:50,020
I need to talk to your boss,

83
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:51,820
right now.

84
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:54,940
(She usually seems pretty sharp.)

85
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:57,220
(How can she be this stupid
when it actually matters?)

86
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:58,940
What are you waiting for?

87
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:05,260
(VIP Room)
Sure, this batch of footage is good.

88
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:07,860
If this takes off,
why would I even need this bar?

89
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:10,020
I'll make a fortune
from membership fees alone.

90
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:10,540
Hey,

91
00:04:10,540 --> 00:04:11,740
where's the restroom?

92
00:04:11,740 --> 00:04:13,420
I've been wandering around forever.
I'm completely lost.

93
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:16,220
(VIP Room)

94
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:17,020
You need the restroom?

95
00:04:17,380 --> 00:04:17,980
Follow me.

96
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:19,620
Thanks.

97
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:26,620
Thanks.

98
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:40,660
(VIP Room)

99
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:52,220
(If I call the police now,)

100
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:54,060
(he could just claim someone else
installed the cameras.)

101
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:55,900
(At most, the bar would be
temporarily shut down.)

102
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:57,380
(The police couldn't do much to him.)

103
00:04:58,180 --> 00:05:00,060
(But if I can get some evidence first,)

104
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:01,620
(then call the police,
he won't be able to deny it.)

105
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:08,580
I demand an explanation here.

106
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:10,540
What's with the hidden cameras
in the restroom?

107
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,260
There are cameras in the restroom?

108
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:14,100
I...

109
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:14,780
I have no idea.

110
00:05:15,180 --> 00:05:15,980
Maybe a customer put them there.

111
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:18,060
I'll get equipment today
and check the whole place.

112
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,180
You're lying.

113
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:20,660
There's no way you didn't know.

114
00:05:22,940 --> 00:05:23,780
Look,

115
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:25,420
put everything they ordered tonight

116
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,340
on my tab.

117
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:27,100
It's on the house.

118
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:28,700
I want the videos deleted!

119
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:30,340
Otherwise, I'm calling the police!

120
00:05:35,180 --> 00:05:36,580
What videos?

121
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,140
Call the police?

122
00:05:38,620 --> 00:05:40,220
Making a big deal out of this
won't be good for anyone.

123
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:41,260
Think about it.

124
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:42,940
There are millions of people online.

125
00:05:43,580 --> 00:05:44,580
Who'd know who's in the videos?

126
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:46,580
If you call the police and blow it up,
everyone will go looking for you.

127
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:48,740
I'm telling you,

128
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:50,060
you're not getting away with this!

129
00:05:50,340 --> 00:05:51,860
My friend is already
collecting evidence.

130
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:53,620
If you don't delete those videos,

131
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:54,900
I'll make sure you rot in prison!

132
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:56,500
You're not going anywhere!

133
00:06:16,580 --> 00:06:17,220
What are you doing?

134
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:19,620
You installed those hidden cameras
in the restroom, didn't you?

135
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,340
Where's your proof?

136
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:21,940
It's all on this laptop.

137
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:23,420
Why else would you be so nervous?

138
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:24,540
And now you're trying to frame me?

139
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:25,740
You're only making yourself
look guiltier.

140
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:41,100
Call the police!

141
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:42,620
Okay.

142
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:44,540
Hello?

143
00:06:44,660 --> 00:06:45,460
Is this emergency service?

144
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:46,940
That was an assault with a weapon.

145
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:48,420
You know how many years
that could get you?

146
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:49,860
She stole my laptop.

147
00:06:50,420 --> 00:06:51,380
I've got security footage.

148
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:53,220
Save your excuses for the police.

149
00:07:08,140 --> 00:07:08,700
Mr. He,

150
00:07:08,820 --> 00:07:10,940
a man claiming to be your friend
is here to see you.

151
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,540
What's his name?

152
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:13,820
Wang Haotian.

153
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:19,380
Still denying it?

154
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:21,420
(Clouds Drift, Waters Flow)
Wang Haotian has already identified you.

155
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:24,220
He said you broke into their factory
and stole their things.

156
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:25,260
And you still won't admit it?

157
00:07:25,460 --> 00:07:26,900
I told you, it wasn't me!

158
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:27,740
You...

159
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:29,500
You still won't admit it?

160
00:07:29,580 --> 00:07:31,220
That boy was only fifteen!

161
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:32,460
He caught you stealing,

162
00:07:32,860 --> 00:07:33,780
and you...

163
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:36,620
kicked him off a high wall!

164
00:07:36,780 --> 00:07:38,140
His manhood got injured.

165
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:40,580
He'll never be able to have a wife!

166
00:07:40,660 --> 00:07:41,180
(Clouds Drift, Waters Flow)
I...

167
00:07:41,180 --> 00:07:41,780
(Clouds Drift, Waters Flow)
Disgraceful brat!

168
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:42,660
I'll beat the crap out of you!

169
00:07:43,260 --> 00:07:44,740
I must beat you into a pulp,

170
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:47,020
or I won't be able to face his parents!

171
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:48,180
(Clouds Drift, Waters Flow)
Disgraceful brat!

172
00:07:48,260 --> 00:07:49,140
Truly disgraceful!

173
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:50,380
I'll beat you into a pulp!

174
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:53,220
If you don't want me living here,

175
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:54,860
just say so!

176
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:56,300
You...

177
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:03,700
Mr. He!

178
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:06,690
Wow.

179
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:08,700
Not bad at all.

180
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:14,300
What are you doing here?

181
00:08:15,260 --> 00:08:16,460
Back when your dad

182
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:18,180
brought you to see me at the hospital,

183
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:20,100
I never forgot your face.

184
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:22,340
I recognized you the second
I saw you yesterday.

185
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:24,700
Didn't you do time?

186
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:26,500
And now look at you.

187
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:27,740
You're doing pretty well for yourself.

188
00:08:28,740 --> 00:08:29,580
Wang Haotian,

189
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:31,820
just say what you want.

190
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:35,100
I noticed you really care about

191
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:36,460
that Luo... something.

192
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:36,980
Oh, right,

193
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:38,900
Luo Xiyu.

194
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:41,180
I thought we should have a little talk.

195
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:52,420
Aren't you curious
how I got out so quickly?

196
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:55,940
Sure, Luo Xiyu stole my laptop...

197
00:08:55,940 --> 00:08:56,780
She didn't steal it.

198
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,540
She was securing evidence
for the police.

199
00:09:00,420 --> 00:09:00,900
Right.

200
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:01,380
Of course.

201
00:09:02,380 --> 00:09:03,180
Evidence.

202
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:05,740
Too bad

203
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:07,180
the evidence

204
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:08,660
wasn't actually on that laptop.

205
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:10,940
The police found nothing.

206
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:12,020
My bar

207
00:09:12,020 --> 00:09:13,380
was shut down for a few days,

208
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:14,660
then reopened.

209
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:16,700
Quite frustrating, isn't it?

210
00:09:21,180 --> 00:09:22,260
That Luo Xiyu...

211
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:23,300
She's quite something.

212
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:25,020
I like her.

213
00:09:25,140 --> 00:09:26,740
If you lay a finger on her,

214
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:29,260
you'll have to deal with me.

215
00:09:32,140 --> 00:09:32,820
Mr. He,

216
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:34,540
did you forget

217
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:36,060
who I have to thank

218
00:09:36,060 --> 00:09:37,380
for ending up half crippled?

219
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:40,140
I wasn't the one who hurt you back then.

220
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:46,460
Can't own up to what you did, Mr. He?

221
00:09:47,340 --> 00:09:49,380
I think it's time we settled our score.

222
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:51,140
Mr. He,

223
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:52,500
you're a powerful man now.

224
00:09:53,020 --> 00:09:53,900
You're hard to get to.

225
00:09:55,340 --> 00:09:56,300
So I'll find someone who isn't.

226
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:01,300
Luo Xiyu has nothing to do with this.

227
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:03,780
If you want someone, come after me.

228
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:08,620
The more worried you get,

229
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,980
the more fun this gets.

230
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:17,180
Bye-bye.

231
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:30,740
Luo Xiyu!

232
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:32,740
What the hell were you thinking?

233
00:10:33,180 --> 00:10:35,220
Right when the company
was choosing a new principal,

234
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:36,220
you went and called the police!

235
00:10:36,260 --> 00:10:37,460
Happy now?

236
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:39,580
Your name's on the list, and mine isn't.

237
00:10:40,300 --> 00:10:42,580
The principal is chosen
through an assessment.

238
00:10:42,820 --> 00:10:44,260
What does that have to do
with calling the police?

239
00:10:44,460 --> 00:10:45,620
How does it not?

240
00:10:45,860 --> 00:10:47,500
Now everyone knows
I was secretly filmed.

241
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:48,820
They're all talking about me
behind my back.

242
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:51,180
Calling the police wasn't
what I intended either.

243
00:10:51,380 --> 00:10:53,260
But I heard the bar owner myself

244
00:10:53,420 --> 00:10:55,180
talking on the phone
about those hidden-camera videos.

245
00:10:55,580 --> 00:10:57,100
That's exactly why you shouldn't
have provoked him!

246
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:59,180
What if he sells my video?

247
00:10:59,220 --> 00:11:00,820
How am I supposed to face anyone?

248
00:11:01,220 --> 00:11:03,660
But if you don't call the police,
you're not solving the real problem.

249
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:05,700
What if he uses the video
to blackmail you?

250
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:08,220
Stop acting like you're some saint!

251
00:11:09,620 --> 00:11:10,220
Hey...

252
00:11:16,740 --> 00:11:17,700
Five-and-a.

253
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:18,620
Six-and-a.

254
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:19,700
Seven-and-a.

255
00:11:19,700 --> 00:11:20,100
Eight.

256
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:21,740
One-and-a.

257
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:22,500
Two-and-a.

258
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:23,700
Are you okay?

259
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:26,060
I'm fine.

260
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:27,020
It's an old problem.

261
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:27,820
My stomach's acting up again.

262
00:11:28,140 --> 00:11:29,260
Do you need to go to the hospital?

263
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:33,340
The show's on the fourth.

264
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:34,500
Don't let me hold up the rehearsal.

265
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:36,660
Let's keep going.

266
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:38,740
Okay.

267
00:11:47,620 --> 00:11:48,460
Five-and-a.

268
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:49,340
Six-and-a.

269
00:11:49,340 --> 00:11:50,260
Seven-and-a.

270
00:11:50,380 --> 00:11:50,780
Eight.

271
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:52,820
One-and-a.

272
00:11:52,820 --> 00:11:53,820
Two-and-a.

273
00:11:55,820 --> 00:11:57,380
You should really go to the hospital.

274
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:58,300
Go now and come right back.

275
00:11:58,660 --> 00:12:00,060
We can't do this without our Black Swan.

276
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:02,260
I'll take you to the hospital.

277
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:06,340
Can you take me?

278
00:12:07,380 --> 00:12:08,020
Me?

279
00:12:08,780 --> 00:12:10,260
Your mom works in gastroenterology,

280
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:11,940
and you know the hospital well.

281
00:12:12,420 --> 00:12:13,460
We'll be back in no time.

282
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:14,940
We can't hold up the rehearsal.

283
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:18,300
Okay.

284
00:12:22,060 --> 00:12:23,060
My ride's here.

285
00:12:40,180 --> 00:12:40,860
Sir,

286
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:42,180
I forgot my health insurance card.

287
00:12:42,180 --> 00:12:43,140
Could you stop for a second?

288
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,900
Whatever you need,
I can grab it for you.

289
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:46,220
I know where it is.

290
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:47,180
I'll be right back.

291
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,620
Please wait for me.

292
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:06,100
Relax.

293
00:13:06,340 --> 00:13:07,020
I didn't drug it.

294
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:09,460
What do I have to do

295
00:13:09,660 --> 00:13:11,220
to get you to delete my video?

296
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:14,980
You want me to pay you?

297
00:13:15,260 --> 00:13:16,180
How much?

298
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:16,940
I'll find a way to get it.

299
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:18,740
I don't want money.

300
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:20,740
But there is

301
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:21,380
one way.

302
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:22,700
It'd be good for both of us.

303
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:15,030
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

304
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:21,240
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

305
00:14:22,570 --> 00:14:25,590
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

306
00:14:25,590 --> 00:14:28,580
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

307
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:31,300
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

308
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:34,750
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

309
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:41,000
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

310
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:47,600
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

311
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:50,890
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

312
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:54,640
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

313
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:57,580
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

314
00:14:57,580 --> 00:15:01,840
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

315
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:04,370
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

316
00:15:04,370 --> 00:15:08,040
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

317
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:10,390
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

318
00:15:10,390 --> 00:15:14,620
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

319
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:18,420
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

320
00:15:18,420 --> 00:15:21,430
♪I could give you another future♪

321
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:27,980
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

322
00:15:27,980 --> 00:15:30,250
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

323
00:15:30,250 --> 00:15:31,890
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

324
00:15:31,890 --> 00:15:33,750
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

325
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:35,940
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

326
00:15:35,940 --> 00:15:39,840
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

327
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:43,830
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪
